Is your controller a plain SCSI controller, or a RAID controller (eg
SWXCR)?  There are some firmware issues to solve before you can use the
SWXCR under Linux.  (I have one, and haven't solved them yet, so we just
used two RZ29s attached to a FW SCSI controller for now.)

