To boot the client I use the following command in the SRM console:

 >>>boot ewa0 -flags "nfsroot=xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx:/tftpboot/ltsroot"

(xxx.xxx.xxx.xxx = IP-Address of the server)

Now the client starts to boot the kernel (bootpfile), but at the point 
