Though it was many years ago, I'm reasonably sure that I remember Stratus as
using the 'pair and spare' approach.  Unfortunately, Jim Gray's 'Transaction
Processing' doesn't attribute it to anyone specifically, nor have any entry
for Stratus in the index:  is there any possibility that they changed
technology at some point?

>
> Tandem on the other hand used Dual Modular Redundancy(DMR) which gives you
